WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
Review the current PDF and applied changes, then close Simple Office Tools.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:08.900
Reopen the app; the Windows desktop is blurred for privacy while the app restarts.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.000
At Continue where you left off?, review the saved work details and choose Continue previous work.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Wait while the saved documents and changes are restored.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.430
The previous PDF reopens with its applied changes ready to continue.
